type: software
title: "AgingResearch.News MCP server"
abstract: >-
  Open configuration files that connect AI assistants (Claude, ChatGPT,
  VS Code, Cursor and any MCP client) to the public AgingResearch.News MCP
  server, which searches new papers on aging and age-related disease with
  their study type, evidence, clinical trials and research grants.
